Built-in drum kits
-------------------

The DUSTY JAZZ, BOOM BAP, VINYL SOUL, LO-FI TAPE, and CLEAN STUDIO kits are
original deterministic PCM synthesis implemented in
app/src/main/java/com/choplab/sampler/audio/BuiltInDrumKits.kt. They do not
contain copied or downloaded third-party drum recordings. The implementation
and generated sounds are distributed with ChopLab under the MIT License.

